Capacity Atlas takes design inspiration from Google DeepMind's Formal
Conjectures project, especially its statement-first registry, structured
metadata, external formal-proof links, separation of reusable definitions from
problem statements, and compact browse interface. Capacity Atlas is an
independent project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google DeepMind.
See ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md for the full citation and adopted design elements.
